### RULES

1. Each @task tests ONE endpoint with VALID data
2. Use weights: @task(10) for critical paths, @task(5) for secondary
3. Store IDs from POST responses for use in GET/PUT/DELETE
4. Name tasks: `{action}_{resource}_valid()` or `{action}_{resource}_complete()`

